-- lo que dice ?arima de transform.pars (texto de la ayuda instalada):
transform.pars: logical; if true, the AR parameters are transformed to
          ensure that they remain in the region of stationarity.  Not
          used for 'method = "CSS"'.  For 'method = "ML"', it has been
          advantageous to set 'transform.pars = FALSE' in some cases,
          see also 'fixed'.
-- ?arima.sim, n.start:
 n.start: length of 'burn-in' period.  If 'NA', the default, a
          reasonable value is computed.
